function selectGroup(g){for(const b of filters.children)b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(Number(b.dataset.group)===g));grid.replaceChildren();galleryPhotos.forEach(photo=>{if(g!==-1&&photo.group!==g)return;const fig=document.createElement('figure'),img=document.createElement('img'),label=document.createElement('figcaption');img.src=photo.src;img.alt=photo.alt;img.loading='lazy';img.style.objectPosition=photo.position;label.textContent=photo.alt+' / '+groups[photo.group];fig.append(img,label);grid.append(fig)})}
['All photos',...groups].forEach((name,i)=>{const b=document.createElement('button');b.type='button';b.dataset.group=i-1;b.textContent=name;b.addEventListener('click',()=>selectGroup(i-1));filters.append(b)});
const routes=['home','about','work','services','congo','gallery'];
function pageRoute(){const target=location.hash.slice(1)||'home';const page=routes.includes(target)?target:'home';document.body.classList.remove('gallery-open');document.body.dataset.page=page;gallery.hidden=page!=='gallery';document.querySelectorAll('main>section').forEach(section=>section.hidden=page==='home'?section===gallery:section.id!==page);document.querySelectorAll('#nav a').forEach(a=>{if(a.hash==='#'+page)a.setAttribute('aria-current','page');else a.removeAttribute('aria-current')});if(page==='gallery')selectGroup(-1);document.title=(page==='home'?'Silver Road Productions':({'about':'About Us','work':'Our work','services':'Services','congo':'Film in Congo','gallery':'Gallery'}[page])+' — Silver Road Productions');requestAnimationFrame(()=>{if(routes.includes(target)||target==='')window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'instant'});else document.getElementById(target)?.scrollIntoView({block:'start',behavior:'instant'})})}
addEventListener('hashchange',pageRoute);pageRoute();

(()=>{const reel=document.querySelector('.place-reel'),slides=[...reel.querySelectorAll('figure')],[prev,toggle,next]=reel.querySelectorAll('button'),count=reel.querySelector('#place-count');let index=0,paused=matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches,visible=false;
function show(n){index=(n+slides.length)%slides.length;slides.forEach((s,i)=>s.hidden=i!==index);count.textContent=String(index+1).padStart(2,'0')+' / '+String(slides.length).padStart(2,'0')}
function label(){toggle.textContent=paused?'Play':'Pause';toggle.setAttribute('aria-label',(paused?'Play':'Pause')+' slideshow')}
prev.onclick=()=>show(index-1);next.onclick=()=>show(index+1);toggle.onclick=()=>{paused=!paused;label()};label();new IntersectionObserver(([entry])=>visible=entry.isIntersecting).observe(reel);setInterval(()=>{if(visible&&!paused&&!document.hidden&&!reel.matches(':hover')&&!reel.contains(document.activeElement))show(index+1)},6000)})();
